# Claude Code local settings (machine-specific) -- but .claude/agents/ is
# tracked on purpose: custom subagent definitions (code-reviewer,
# security-reviewer) are project config, not local state, and gitignored
# files don't reliably persist across sessions on this machine.
.claude/*
!.claude/agents
